SUMMARY:WORLD PLAY - Chapter 6: Freedom
DESCRIPTION:Koffler Arts invites you to the sixth chapter of WORLD PLAY\, an ongoing series curated by Alon Nashman\, that celebrates Toronto’s extraordinary linguistic and cultural diversity. \nEach edition brings together participants with diverse mother tongues who read excerpts of poetry\, theatre\, fiction\, philosophy\, and song lyrics in both their original language and in English translation. This chapter’s theme is “Freedom”. \nFollowing the event\, we’ll gather for an informal reception to connect and continue the conversation over light snacks and refreshments. \nJoin us as a reader or listener for an immersive journey into phonaesthetics.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/world-play-chapter-6-freedom/
LOCATION:Youngplace\, 180 Shaw St\, unit 101\, Toronto\, ON M6J 2W5\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6J 2W5
CATEGORIES:Community Events,Literature & Spoken Word
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/world-play-chapter-6-freedom.png
END:VEVENT
