SUMMARY:May the 4th: Rogue One: A Star Wars Story
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate May the 4th with a 10th anniversary screening of Rogue One! \nFormer scientist Galen Erso lives on a farm with his wife and young daughter\, Jyn. His peaceful existence comes crashing down when the evil Orson Krennic takes him away from his beloved family. Many years later\, Galen becomes the Empire’s lead engineer for the most powerful weapon in the galaxy\, the Death Star. Knowing that her father holds the key to its destruction\, Jyn joins forces with a spy and other resistance fighters to steal the space station’s plans for the Rebel Alliance. \nA story set apart from the classic instalments of the Star Wars saga\, Rogue One brings a unique perspective to the galaxy far\, far away.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/may-the-4th-rogue-one-a-star-wars-story/
LOCATION:2236 Queen Street East\, 2236 Queen St E\, Toronto\, ON M4E 1G2\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M4E 1G2
CATEGORIES:Film & Media
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/may-the-4th-rogue-one-a-star-wars-story.png
END:VEVENT
